    "sentence_translations": [
      "Do You Want to go to Space?",
      "",
      "Do you want to go to space? Now, your wish can come true!",
      "",
      "According to a Reuter’s News Agency report, ..",
      ".. NASA is going to allow ordinary people to stay at the International Space Station for a month.",
      "Such flights might be realized in 2020 at the earliest.",
      "",
      "Of course, going to space is certainly not any ordinary flight, so its price is really not low.",
      "According to a NASA estimate, ..",
      ".. every passenger’s flight cost would be about 50 million US dollars (equivalent to 347 million RMB), ..",
      ".. still not including food and other expenses.",
      "Someone made a rough calculation, ..",
      ".. that the cost for every space traveler would be approximately 35 000 US dollars per night.",
      "",
      "Until now, only astronauts could take a spaceship to space.",
      "In the near future, ordinary people will also be able to go to space!",
      "Are you interested in this kind of space travel?",
      ""
    ]
  }
